# Hutao Yelan Mona Nicole. ~18s Rot. Hutao Hex Vape. Hutao 8[N2CD] + (N2Q / N2CD). Mona E Q N1. Hutao Vapes ~56% of her CAs. C0 Mona is ~18K DPS loss.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
